        "title": "Expert Backed Review Summary",
        "text": "<p>Hero Cosmetics Mighty Patch Original is a targeted acne patch designed to manage visible whiteheads using medical-grade hydrocolloid technology. Hydrocolloid dressings are widely used in dermatological care because they absorb excess fluid while maintaining a protected environment over the affected area. Applied directly to a whitehead, the patch works to draw out impurities while shielding the blemish from external irritants. The patch is ultra-thin and adhesive enough to stay in place for several hours, making it suitable for overnight treatment. During this time, the hydrocolloid layer absorbs buildup from the pimple while creating a physical barrier that discourages touching, picking, or popping. This protective layer helps reduce the likelihood of additional irritation that can occur when blemishes are repeatedly handled.</p>",
